					Consumes the mark and triggers an explosion dealing 50% of the triggering attack's actual damage.
					Also releases a Topaz Bolt dealing 100% of the weapon damage when the mark was applied.
					On hit, it explodes in a 6-tile radius; the explosion deals 50% of the Topaz Bolt's damage.
