					Converts the held magic weapon into summon damage, with base damage equal to 65% of the weapon's displayed damage.
					Hits apply "Crystalline Aquamarine Mark" for 5 seconds.
					Only one Contract Mark can exist at a time; applying a new mark replaces the existing one.

					When a minion or sentry attacks a target with "Crystalline Aquamarine Mark":
					Consumes the mark and triggers an explosion dealing 100% of the triggering attack's actual damage.
					Also releases a Crystalline Aquamarine Bolt dealing 170% of the weapon damage when the mark was applied.
					It can pierce 5 enemies; damage is reduced by 15% after each hit, plus 2 Crystalline Shards.
					'''
				DisplayName: Crystalline Aquamarine Contract
			}

			StyxBloodAnkh: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Blood commands the soul.

					While the scythe is spinning, once every second it throws a copy of the scythe directly toward the cursor, dealing 75% of the current scythe's damage.
					The phantom cannot grant Soul Essence.

					Hitting an enemy with the scythe's phantom inflicts "Holy Wrath".
					Enemies affected by "Holy Wrath" take 15% increased damage.

					Dealing damage with a scythe grants 1 Blood Charge.
					At maximum Blood Charge, the scythe's next attack deals double damage and heals you for 20% of the damage dealt.

					Nearby allies gain "Bloodlust", giving their attacks a 1/3 chance to steal 1 life.

					"I've had enough of being human!!"
					'''
				DisplayName: Styx Blood Ankh
			}

			SpiritFireScythe: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Spirit Fire shines upon life.

					While the scythe is spinning, once every second it throws a copy of the scythe directly toward the cursor, dealing 50% of the current scythe's damage.
					The phantom cannot grant Soul Essence.

					Killing a target with the scythe's phantom releases a Life Spirit.
					The Life Spirit seeks the ally with the lowest health and heals them for 2 life.
					'''
				DisplayName: Spirit Fire Scythe
			}

			SoulOfScythe: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					The Soul of the Scythe.

					While the scythe is spinning, once every second it throws a copy of the scythe directly toward the cursor, dealing 50% of the current scythe's damage.
					The phantom cannot grant Soul Essence.
					'''
				DisplayName: Soul of the Scythe
			}

			RadiantHolyAnkh: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Radiance illuminates the soul.

					While the scythe is spinning, once every second it throws a radiant phantom of the current scythe directly toward the cursor, dealing 60% of the current scythe's damage.
					The phantom can grant Soul Essence.

					Hitting an enemy with the scythe's phantom inflicts "Holy Wrath" and "Tuned".
					Enemies affected by "Holy Wrath" and "Tuned" take 25% increased damage.

					Each time you gain 1 Soul Essence this way, nearby allies gain a Life Shield equal to 1% of their maximum life.
					When Soul Essence is consumed, nearby allies gain "Bulwark Bubble" for 1 second.

					"Who needs support!"
					'''
				DisplayName: Radiant Holy Ankh
			}

			Anubis: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					The god of death watches the prey.

					While the scythe is spinning, once every second it throws a copy of the scythe directly toward the cursor, dealing 75% of the current scythe's damage.
					The phantom cannot grant Soul Essence.

					Killing a target with the scythe's phantom restores 3 life.
					Hitting an enemy with the scythe's phantom inflicts "Holy Wrath".
					Enemies affected by "Holy Wrath" take 15% increased damage.
					'''
				DisplayName: Anubis
			}

			InspirationWirelessHeadphones: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Increases maximum Inspiration by 5
					Each active unique empowerment increases movement speed by 2% and playing speed by 1%
					Every 70 Inspiration consumed grants 5 seconds of "Inspiration Overflow"
					'''
				DisplayName: Inspiration Wireless Headphones
			}

			OrchestraConductorScore: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Soundwave damage increased by 12%
					Soundwave playing speed increased by 12%
					Inspiration regeneration speed increased by 12%
					When you and a nearby ally attack the same target, the enemy takes bonus damage equal to 30% of the combined damage
					This effect can trigger only once every 2 seconds on the same target
					'''
				DisplayName: Orchestra Conductor Score
			}

			CrystalKineticConverter: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Inspiration regeneration rate increased by 10%
					Stores up to 1500 soundwave damage dealt
					When fully charged, consumes all stored damage and activates Crystal Kinetic Conversion
					When activated, you and nearby allies gain 15% increased damage and 10 armor penetration for 30 seconds
					Each nearby ally increases soundwave playing speed by 5%
					'''
				DisplayName: Crystal Kinetic Converter
			}
		}

